ObjectStream contains code derived from the Qwen and Hugging Face Transformers
Qwen2.5-VL implementation, and from the FluxMem inference/preprocessing code.
Original copyright headers are retained; the accompanying Apache-2.0 LICENSE
applies to those components. The Qwen2.5 implementation is in qwen2.5-vl-7b/;
the native Qwen3.5 implementation is in qwen3.5-9b/. Each version's
docs/IMPLEMENTATION.md describes its integration and source attribution.

Qwen3.5 uses the separately installed, unmodified Transformers model and native
processor. It does not redistribute model weights or benchmark videos. The
ObjectStream memory, sparse-layout adapter, and integration code are provided
in this repository. No third-party branding or benchmark score is an endorsement.
